{"type":"text","timestamp":1784796065131,"sessionID":"ses_071de52daffeLfkkf5bpEtF6ET","part":{"id":"prt_f8e229faf0019qsZ4DchL1IqbN","messageID":"msg_f8e22934c001OaubWbbEAuzuGy","sessionID":"ses_071de52daffeLfkkf5bpEtF6ET","type":"text","text":"查询完成。单键分子中氧原子的平均数量约为 **3.11**。\n\n**计算逻辑：**\n1. 从 bond 表筛选 bond_type = '-' 的单键分子\n2. 关联 atom 表，筛选 element = 'o' 的氧原子\n3. 按分子分组统计每个分子的氧原子数\n4. 对所有单键分子的氧原子数求平均值\n\nFinal Answer: 3.109704641350211\nEvidence SQL: SELECT AVG(oxygen_count) as avg_oxygen FROM (SELECT a.molecule_id, COUNT(*) as oxygen_count FROM atom a INNER JOIN (SELECT DISTINCT molecule_id FROM bond WHERE bond_type = '-') b ON a.molecule_id = b.molecule_id WHERE a.element = 'o' GROUP BY a.molecule_id)","time":{"start":1784796061615,"end":1784796065127}}}
